WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:04.070 --> 00:06.000
Sir, please mind your hand.

3
00:24.450 --> 00:29.950
[Farrer Park Hospital]

4
01:04.780 --> 01:06.320
Morning.

5
01:06.320 --> 01:08.950
- Morning. - How are you feeling?

6
01:09.670 --> 01:11.250
Better.

7
01:11.250 --> 01:12.910
Sorry for collapsing yesterday.

8
01:12.910 --> 01:15.520
You don't need to apologize.

9
01:15.520 --> 01:18.590
It's my duty to help you out.

10
01:21.200 --> 01:26.000
For now, just focus on getting through your first day at work.

11
01:26.650 --> 01:29.180
And contact me if anything happens.

12
01:29.180 --> 01:31.510
I'll come to you right away.

13
01:34.390 --> 01:37.800
- Have some breakfast. - Thanks.

14
01:40.170 --> 01:42.450
I don't see the baby.

15
01:42.450 --> 01:43.860
Neither do I.

16
01:43.860 --> 01:46.170
They're in there somewhere.

17
01:47.010 --> 01:51.010
How about we change our point of view?

18
01:51.010 --> 01:53.140
Let's try looking from over there.

19
01:54.780 --> 01:56.550
Found them!

20
01:56.550 --> 02:02.830
Orangutans zip across the trees here, just like in their natural habitats.

21
02:02.830 --> 02:05.020
So looking for them is part of the experience.

22
02:05.020 --> 02:08.960
Indeed. It's rewarding when you manage to find them.

23
02:09.930 --> 02:12.420
I see more over there!

24
02:14.700 --> 02:17.830
It's only your first day, and you're already a pro.

25
02:17.830 --> 02:21.180
Thanks, but I have a ways to go.

26
02:27.460 --> 02:30.520
[Eita: How're you faring?]

27
03:11.580 --> 03:15.960
Sakura...

28
03:19.600 --> 03:22.580
We're able to tour the gallery at 3PM...

29
03:25.400 --> 03:27.210
I wasn't drawing some individual

30
03:30.110 --> 03:32.400
I only met yesterday.

31
03:34.420 --> 03:36.110
I've...

32
03:37.140 --> 03:39.990
I've always been drawing her.

33
03:50.140 --> 03:52.800
You know where this room is, don't you?

34
03:54.580 --> 03:56.330
She only looks similar to your muse.

35
04:00.480 --> 04:02.880
- I've heard enough. - Where are you going?

36
04:02.880 --> 04:04.420
Inside my sketches.

37
04:04.420 --> 04:07.050
Find that room, and you'll never come back.

38
04:12.550 --> 04:14.500
From where?

39
04:23.760 --> 04:26.820
We'll need to check the alleyway buildings. [Katong Next Project]

40
04:26.820 --> 04:30.220
Ownership gets complicated there, so some rooms are still furnished.

41
04:30.220 --> 04:31.680
Have you asked the locals about them?

42
04:31.680 --> 04:33.420
We're just about ready to do so.

43
04:33.420 --> 04:36.150
I'll handle that job.

44
04:36.150 --> 04:37.520
I want to survey the area anyway.

45
04:37.520 --> 04:39.570
But nothing's confirmed yet.

46
04:39.570 --> 04:42.820
It'll help to get a general feel of the neighborhood.

47
04:42.820 --> 04:46.460
If you say so. Then we'll let you handle it.

48
04:46.460 --> 04:49.560
Lee, can you check plot 29? [203]

49
04:49.560 --> 04:51.400
Okay, Natsume. [Artwork contact: TAN LEI]

50
04:51.400 --> 04:55.470
The first half is a collaboration with Mandai, so... landscapes.

51
04:55.470 --> 04:57.640
Then gradually, portraits.

52
04:57.640 --> 05:00.670
Please keep the last painting empty for now.

53
05:01.690 --> 05:04.020
A new piece at last?

54
05:05.140 --> 05:07.480
Yes.

55
05:07.480 --> 05:09.530
I can't wait.

56
05:14.700 --> 05:15.970
Excuse me.

57
05:15.970 --> 05:17.260
Yeah.

58
05:19.040 --> 05:20.690
Hi, this is Tan Lei.

59
05:20.690 --> 05:23.710
This is Nishikido, from Junto Real Estate.

60
05:23.710 --> 05:28.330
I'd like to ask about the artworks left in 203.

61
05:28.330 --> 05:30.160
They're in storage.

62
05:30.160 --> 05:31.420
I see.

63
05:31.420 --> 05:35.050
Then could we arrange a time to check them?

64
05:53.350 --> 06:00.590
[Eita: Done with work? I can pick you up.]

65
06:00.590 --> 06:05.160
[It's fine. I'm heading straight home.]

66
06:06.170 --> 06:09.980
For Katong, please transfer here.

67
06:11.640 --> 06:17.690
[I'll be back after a slight detour.]

68
06:19.560 --> 06:23.060
[I'll be back after a slight detour.]

69
06:29.850 --> 06:33.690
[Location: Sakura]

70
06:42.670 --> 06:45.280
[Lei]

71
07:01.180 --> 07:03.100
Welcome.

72
07:05.630 --> 07:07.710
Is Lun here?

73
07:10.120 --> 07:12.180
I see.

74
07:19.240 --> 07:22.780
You... wait?

75
07:25.160 --> 07:27.290
Coffee?

76
07:27.290 --> 07:29.040
Yes.

77
07:42.160 --> 07:44.040
Thank you.

78
07:53.210 --> 07:57.490
I knew it. I know this flavor.

79
08:04.540 --> 08:08.490
I was here, four years ago...

80
08:08.490 --> 08:10.060
Maybe.

81
08:11.000 --> 08:13.200
But I don't remember.

82
08:19.620 --> 08:21.980
You know this key, right?

83
08:25.510 --> 08:29.120
You know it, right?

84
08:34.860 --> 08:39.720
Some things are better left unknown.

85
08:48.840 --> 08:50.700
Something is there.

86
09:09.160 --> 09:11.680
My body remembers.

87
10:26.670 --> 10:28.250
Woah!

88
10:31.760 --> 10:33.640
I know this place.

89
10:35.180 --> 10:39.010
Hello, I left my sketchbook here yesterday...

90
10:43.520 --> 10:45.520
Is she here?

91
10:45.520 --> 10:46.980
She just left.

92
10:46.980 --> 10:48.720
Where did she go?

93
11:02.270 --> 11:05.040
I see you also can't help but look.

94
11:09.000 --> 11:12.230
You know of this key, yes?

95
11:18.230 --> 11:22.050
You're better off knowing no more.

96
11:23.930 --> 11:26.350
If you truly believe so,

97
11:27.360 --> 11:29.980
why look so distraught?

98
11:34.250 --> 11:38.660
203 isn't a room number.

99
11:38.660 --> 11:41.900
It's the name of an old building

100
11:41.900 --> 11:45.700
that was managed by my late husband.

101
11:45.700 --> 11:50.060
And I resided there?

102
11:53.970 --> 11:56.140
It was your atelier.

103
11:57.080 --> 11:59.550
And, a place you called home.

104
12:00.220 --> 12:02.200
Did she also live there?

105
12:08.640 --> 12:11.000
You really shouldn't go.

106
12:15.590 --> 12:21.240
She should already be there, right?

107
13:36.050 --> 13:38.120
[Buy coffee beans before we run out]

108
13:38.120 --> 13:40.140
[Don't put laundry away while it's still damp]

109
13:40.140 --> 13:42.160
[Soak the dishes before washing]

110
13:48.550 --> 13:50.430
This is my handwriting.

111
14:13.300 --> 14:15.200
Sakura.

112
14:15.870 --> 14:17.170
Lun.

113
14:59.130 --> 15:01.040
This is the place.

114
15:01.040 --> 15:02.370
Huh?

115
15:06.010 --> 15:08.840
This is the place I've been drawing.

116
15:08.840 --> 15:10.960
I used to paint here.

117
15:15.240 --> 15:19.850
But... I don't remember anything from four years ago.

118
15:19.850 --> 15:21.510
Me too.

119
15:23.270 --> 15:24.960
You too?

120
15:26.550 --> 15:29.710
We lived here?

121
15:31.880 --> 15:33.840
I think so.

122
15:38.440 --> 15:40.480
"Sorry."

123
15:40.480 --> 15:41.860
Is it the same meaning?

124
15:41.860 --> 15:44.190
Yes. Same meaning.

125
16:07.520 --> 16:09.730
Still your spot?

126
16:09.730 --> 16:12.800
But this side is bigger.

127
16:14.000 --> 16:16.140
Maybe you wanted to be near me?

128
16:16.140 --> 16:19.150
Maybe, you wanted to draw near me.

129
16:20.350 --> 16:24.640
Yeah, you're right. Maybe I wanted to be near you.

130
16:27.900 --> 16:32.900
I wonder how we lived here?

131
16:34.100 --> 16:36.470
You used to scold me a lot.

132
16:40.680 --> 16:42.700
Look at the notes over there.

133
17:06.350 --> 17:07.730
Sorry.

134
17:07.730 --> 17:11.070
You just spoke Japanese.

135
17:11.070 --> 17:12.680
Huh?

136
17:12.680 --> 17:16.070
Right, why did I speak in Japanese?

137
17:18.240 --> 17:21.580
I think I used to say that, when you looked angry.

138
17:22.500 --> 17:24.450
Angry now?

139
17:26.540 --> 17:28.010
Nope.

140
17:37.140 --> 17:38.950
Lei?

141
17:38.950 --> 17:40.530
Let's go.

142
17:43.160 --> 17:46.340
You knew this place, didn't you?

143
17:52.040 --> 17:54.190
Let's go.

144
17:54.190 --> 17:56.550
Why didn't you ever tell me?

145
17:59.390 --> 18:01.080
Lun!

146
18:03.050 --> 18:05.290
What happened to us?

147
18:05.290 --> 18:07.860
I don't remember anything.

148
18:07.860 --> 18:09.440
Really?

149
18:10.840 --> 18:12.460
I see.

150
18:14.660 --> 18:18.460
So you got the chance to forget.

151
18:18.460 --> 18:21.180
- Lei. - You know,

152
18:21.180 --> 18:23.640
even after you forgot,

153
18:24.460 --> 18:26.220
Lun...

154
18:26.220 --> 18:31.940
He kept painting this room over, and over, and over again, for four years.

155
18:31.940 --> 18:35.700
Four years, someone with no name or face.

156
18:35.700 --> 18:39.050
- I'm sorry. - Don't apologize.

157
18:39.050 --> 18:41.760
You don't remember, right?

158
18:43.840 --> 18:48.450
Lun. Leave now, and you can still...

159
18:49.920 --> 18:52.410
Still, what?

160
18:52.410 --> 18:55.150
He shouldn't come back here.

161
18:55.150 --> 18:56.220
Why?

162
18:56.220 --> 18:58.670
Because coming back here would...

163
18:58.670 --> 19:01.310
It would break him.

164
19:01.310 --> 19:02.980
Hold on.

165
19:05.000 --> 19:06.970
Break me?

166
19:07.630 --> 19:09.470
Both of you.

167
19:16.260 --> 19:18.030
Can you wait here?

168
19:29.970 --> 19:31.550
Over here.

169
19:34.210 --> 19:35.800
Sakura.

170
19:37.870 --> 19:39.710
I came to get you.

171
19:40.790 --> 19:42.120
Sorry.

172
19:42.120 --> 19:45.840
I told you, no need to apologize.

173
19:47.450 --> 19:48.980
Let's go home.

174
19:53.530 --> 19:55.070
Sakura!

175
19:58.980 --> 20:00.940
She's tired.

176
20:15.140 --> 20:17.080
Are you thirsty?

177
20:17.080 --> 20:19.830
No, I'm fine.

178
20:23.080 --> 20:24.690
Then are you hungry?

179
20:24.690 --> 20:26.760
I can make us something when we get back.

180
20:27.450 --> 20:31.000
Okay. Thanks.

181
22:09.330 --> 22:10.980
Eita?

182
22:11.840 --> 22:14.980
Sorry. I was worried, so...

183
22:16.480 --> 22:18.450
You saw?

184
22:18.450 --> 22:20.580
You kept it.

185
22:30.280 --> 22:32.460
Eat, breakfast will get cold.

186
22:43.230 --> 22:45.330
What do you know?

187
22:45.870 --> 22:48.990
I knew about the man named Lun.

188
22:48.990 --> 22:50.940
Did you also know about 203?

189
22:51.660 --> 22:53.450
Yeah.

190
22:53.450 --> 22:55.010
For how long?

191
22:55.010 --> 22:57.440
Since before we started dating.

192
22:57.440 --> 23:00.390
Why didn't you ever tell me?

193
23:00.390 --> 23:03.620
Because you said you didn't want to remember.

194
23:04.900 --> 23:13.010
[Next]
